{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/377638-ctd-the-immortal-eyes-trilogy","id":377638,"title":"[CtD] The Immortal Eyes Trilogy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-21T17:55:00-08:00","id":377638,"title":"[CtD] The Immortal Eyes Trilogy","content":"I picked up all three parts of the Immortal Eyes trilogy on sale at my FLGS this week. Does anyone have any experience with this series of books? I am thinking about setting up the chronicle for my kids (teens and pre-teens), but I haven't had a free moment to read all of the material. Any thoughts on the chronicle in particular? Or on running it for a younger troupe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T19:12:09-08:00","id":379741,"title":"","content":"I used &quot;The Toybox&quot;, modified it slightly of course. I didn't think it was too bad, but if I had to do it over again I think I would have just used the notes about the setting (re: not go into the novels). I think Changeling could be a great way to get your kids sucked in. I always joke I will with mine once he grows up <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T13:48:14-08:00","id":420606,"title":"","content":"Well considering I read/owned the books as a teenager I would say yes. Just keep in mind there is alot of adult content in those stories. Also be prepared to run it a 1990's period piece. because all the information is dated from the mid-ninties. I hope it goes well and let me know how it pans out. ^_^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}